.TH MKPRJ 1 "October 2026" "prj 4.0.2"
.SH NAME
mkprj \- deprecated compatibility command for prj new
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mkprj
.RI [ new-options ]
.I project
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mkprj
is deprecated. It runs \fBprj new\fR with its arguments and writes a warning
to standard error. Use \fBprj new\fR instead.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR prj (1)
